{"id":19560,"path":"/grammar-points/a2/most-most-of-the-most/","parentId":542,"order":141,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a2","depth":3,"title":"Most, most of, the most","seo":{"title":"Most, most of, the most - Test-English","description":"Learn the difference between \"most\", \"most of\" and \"the most\". Check the grammar rules and do three English grammar exercises.","image":"/media/uploads/most-most-of-the-most.png"},"modified":"2026-02-20T09:04:17","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose <em>most, most of</em> or <em>the most</em> to complete these sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"715\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose <em>most, most of</em> or <em>the most</em> to complete these sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"716\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Fill in the gaps with <em>most, most of</em> or <em>the most</em>.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"717\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h2><strong>Most, most of, the most </strong>: Grammar chart</h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/most_most-of_the-most.png\" alt=\"Educational infographic illustrating the grammatical differences between 'most', 'most of', and 'the most' with examples for each category.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-19639\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h3><strong>Most</strong></h3> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>most</strong> (without <strong>the/this/that/my/etc.</strong>) with nouns to mean ‘the majority of’ something.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>Most of people</strong> </span>can’t work from home. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Most people</strong></span> can’t work from home. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em>I have some bad days, but <span><strong>most days</strong></span> are good.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>We can use&nbsp;<strong>most</strong> + noun to talk about the majority of people or things in general</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>Most students</strong></span> like online learning.</em></li> </ul> <h3><strong>Most of</strong></h3> <p>We use <strong>most of </strong>before<strong> the/this/that/my/etc.</strong></p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>Most of students</strong></span> in my class practice sports. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Most of the students</strong></span> in my class practice sports. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Most of this information</strong></span> is not true.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>We can also use&nbsp;<strong>most of</strong>&nbsp;+ <a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/object-pronouns/\">object pronoun</a>.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>Most of us</strong></span>&nbsp;come from poor families.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>They arrested&nbsp;<span><strong>most of them</strong></span>.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Be careful with this common mistake!</h4> <p>We say <strong>most</strong> or <strong>most of</strong> (NOT <strong>the most</strong>) to talk about the majority of something.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>The most students</strong></span> like online learning. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Most students</strong></span> like online learning. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em><span><strong>The most of us</strong></span> come from poor families. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"/media/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Most of us</strong></span> come from poor families. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"/media/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></li> </ul> <h3><strong>The most</strong></h3> <p>We say the most before <a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/adverbs-manner/\">adjectives or adverbs</a> to make the superlative form.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>These are <span><strong>the most comfortable</strong> </span>sofas you can buy.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>Here, you can find <span><strong>the most beautiful</strong></span> views in the region.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":715,"questions":[{"id":6114,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the people in the audience were wearing masks.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Most","Most of","The most"]}]},{"id":6124,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> people don't wear masks.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Most","Most of","The most"]}]},{"id":6123,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> important things in life are health and love. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["The most","Most","Most of"]}]},{"id":6118,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Chloe invited <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> her friends to her birthday party. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["the most","most of","most"]}]},{"id":6125,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> people in Northern Europe can speak English.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["Most of","Most","The most"]}]},{"id":6117,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Studies show that <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> teenagers need 9 hours of sleep.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["the most","most","most of"]}]},{"id":6122,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He bought <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> expensive watch in the shop.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["most of","the most","most"]}]},{"id":6119,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>There were lots of people and I didn't know <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> them. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["most of","most","the most"]}]},{"id":6120,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> teachers continue using exams.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["The most","Most","Most of"]}]},{"id":6121,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Lori is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> optimistic of the group. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["most","the most","most of"]}]}]},{"id":716,"questions":[{"id":6115,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>At the party, I introduced Sally to ______ my friends.</div>","choices":[{"id":10397,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>most</span>"},{"id":10398,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>most of</span>"},{"id":10399,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>the most</span>"}]},{"id":6135,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>France, Spain and Italy are _____ popular tourist destinations in Europe. </div>","choices":[{"id":10427,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>most</span>"},{"id":10428,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>most of</span>"},{"id":10429,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>the most</span>"}]},{"id":6127,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>______ the students in my class have lunch at the cafeteria. </div>","choices":[{"id":10403,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Most</span>"},{"id":10404,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Most of</span>"},{"id":10405,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>The most</span>"}]},{"id":6128,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ people use social media platforms such as Twitter, Facebook, Instagram, etc.</div>","choices":[{"id":10406,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Most</span>"},{"id":10407,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Most of</span>"},{"id":1