a high risk of fire in <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> areas.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6143,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>They went to <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> famous restaurants in the region.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6116,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> people believe what they read online.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6136,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> mornings, she writes two or three pages.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6140,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He spent <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> his life in prison.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6144,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>These are <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> comfortable shoes in the shop.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6138,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Becoming a professional football player is the dream of <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> young boys.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6141,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the people in my neighbourhood are nice and friendly.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":6142,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>This is <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> ridiculous idea I've ever heard.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}